#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_2R/scripts.inc:9
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_2R_Text_Grunt10Intro"
msgid ""
"I understand everything our leader\n"
"says. But you know what?\p"
"Doing stuff like digging up a super-\n"
"ancient POKéMON and ripping off\l"
"someone's METEORITE…\p"
"I think we're going a little too far.\n"
"What do you think?$"
msgstr ""
"首领说的话我都明白。不过你知道吗？\p"
"挖出超古代的宝可梦，\n"
"还抢走别人的陨石……\p"
"我觉得我们做得有点过分了。你觉得呢？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_2R/scripts.inc:18
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_2R_Text_Grunt10Defeat"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think we are doing something\n"
"wrong somehow.$"
msgstr "是啊，我觉得我们好像在做错事。$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_3F_2R/scripts.inc:22
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_3F_2R_Text_Grunt10PostBattle"
msgid ""
"You know, losing to you cleared my mind.\p"
"The next time I see our leader,\n"
"I'm going to ask him about what we do.$"
msgstr ""
"你知道吗，输给你以后，\n"
"我的头脑清醒多了。\p"
"下次见到首领的时候，\n"
"我要问问他我们到底在做什么。$"
